  "limitations": [
    "CASE-001 is a research-only design-search specimen over a synthetic plane source; no facility, generator, or occupancy is represented.",
    "The screening capability is unqualified and evaluated on a nominal basis; only the transport capability produces a bounded claim, and its interval covers statistical error only.",
    "Executables are bound by digest: a system Python interpreter for the screen and the OpenMC environment's interpreter for transport; neither is a qualified package.",
    "The nuclear data library is identified by the digest of its index; the nuclide files it names are not re-hashed by this case.",
    "An optional connected-agent practicality gate is compiled with exact instructions and a hash-bound implementation. It returns unsuitable finalists to iteration and routes a passing finalist to the user; it never changes Core's technical verdict, and Core does not require the stage when a contract omits it."
  ]
